    "content": "**Quests that give Time Candy: 4,470 Hours Total + ~21-2120 Hours in Variable **\n**3,420 <:gemmo:777119230050828300> Total**\n\nHello, there! I have tired of digging through the couch cushions for spare time candy. So, I decided to catalog the candies and gems you can get via questing.\n\nDM me if you notice anything missing (or if you have a request for a notable drop). Credit to the folk at IT and the IdleOnWiki where I gathered all this info. Also, special thanks to <@576804867042181120> for the feedback <:Hearto:812252292597547018> \n\nThe individual NPC counts below world totals are PER character unless stated otherwise, totals assume completion on all 10 characters. Gem totals do not include everything, only questlines that gave +50 <:gemmo:777119230050828300>.\n*",
